[I] A tool which allows you to compose wallpapers for X

[T] hsetroot is an imlib2-based wallpaper changer for X that can compose the
[T] root window background from images, solid colors and gradients. It
[T] supports tiling, centering, scaling, filling and per-output placement
[T] via Xinerama.

[U] https://github.com/himdel/hsetroot

[A] Hyriand <hyriand@thegraveyard.org>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] base/x11
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL
[V] 1.0.5

[D] 748a86b1d1ecb01e8d1c564c457b5480b4bf810559e61d2f4fd118ad hsetroot-1.0.5.tar.gz http://ftp.netbsd.org/pub/pkgsrc/distfiles/

. package/*/*/modular-x-conf.in

var_append makeinstopt ' ' "PREFIX=$root/$prefix"
